# UI_MOCKUPS.md
## Judge-Facing Demo Interface (Static / Read-Only)

---

## 1. Purpose of These Mockups

These mockups are **conceptual UI layouts** intended to:

- Visually anchor the demo experience
- Guide rapid frontend implementation
- Help judges understand system flow at a glance
- Avoid any implication of clinical or diagnostic use

They are **wireframe-level**, not final product designs.

---

## 2. Global UI Characteristics

- **Theme:** Dark, neutral, technical
- **Typography:** Sans-serif (Inter / IBM Plex / system font)
- **Color usage:**
  - Blue → system actions
  - Green → verified / completed
  - Amber → warnings
  - Red → faults
- **No charts resembling medical signals**
- **No real-time data**

